    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e be able to delete the Collection channel which was created in the system by mistake\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003eI will not keep unnecessary Collection channel information in my system\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDesign:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/d4f196e5-7d0a-4dc9-a6c0-e4c374af9713-81a2/screen/56e7eeab-cea9-4ea1-bd2e-cc5a5b17a929/\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://xd.adobe.com/view/d4f196e5-7d0a-4dc9-a6c0-e4c374af9713-81a2/screen/56e7eeab-cea9-4ea1-bd2e-cc5a5b17a929/\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheck system user permissions to display the delete icon on the Collection channel listing/Collection channel detail page, if no such permission, the delete icon will be disabled\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDelete Collection channel\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAllows to delete all Collection channel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDeleting operation is enabled only if the Collection channel is not connected with the payment package\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on delete icon in system should check if Collection channel can be deleted:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf NO, display warning message \u0026lsquo;You can\u0026rsquo;t delete Collection channel because It is connected with Payment package\u0026rsquo;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf YES display message:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026lsquo;Are you sure you want to delete Collection channel?\u0026rsquo; No, Yes\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo - will close warning Pop-up and do not delete Collection channel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes \u0026ndash; will remove Collection channel and close Pop-up\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWarning message should be managed from the system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to view deleted Collection channel if user has permission \u0026lsquo;View Deleting Collection channel\u0026rsquo;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDeleted Collection channel will be displayed in red in Collection channel listing and will be possible only to preview; No actions are possible on deleted Collection channel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit Log record should be created on deleting process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
                                 "representation":  "storage",
                                 "embeddedContent":  [

                                                     ],
                                 "_expandable":  {
